    <string name="legal_guide_content">Under the revised Karnataka Sandalwood Policy:\n1. Farmers have full ownership of sandalwood trees on their land.\n2. Registration with the Forest Department is required (via Gandha-Siri logs).\n3. Before harvesting, you must inform the Range Forest Officer (RFO).\n4. The department will facilitate the sale through KSDL or open auction.\n5. Transit Pass (TP) is mandatory for moving the logs.</string>
